---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Games Showcase | Agogpixel Studio"
  description="Explore upcoming independent games from Agogpixel Studio."
>
  <div class="py-16 md:py-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <!-- Section Header -->
      <div class="mb-16 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-brand-cyan/30 bg-cosmos-900/90 px-4 py-1.5 font-mono text-xs text-brand-cyan mb-4">
          <span class="inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-cyan animate-pulse"></span>
          <span>Studio Productions</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl font-sans">
          Games Showcase
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg font-sans">
          Retro arcade thrill, tight physics loops, and razor-sharp game feel. Minus the corporate bloat.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Flagship Title: Escape from Cygnus X-1 (Tasteful Coming Soon) -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-cosmos-800 bg-cosmos-900/60 p-8 md:p-12 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-sm relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute -right-20 -bottom-20 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-brand-amber/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

        <div class="max-w-3xl">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-brand-amber/30 bg-brand-amber/10 px-3.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs text-brand-amber mb-6">
            <span class="inline-block h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-brand-amber animate-pulse"></span>
            <span>Debut Title • In Active Development</span>
          </div>

          <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white sm:text-4xl font-sans tracking-tight">
            Escape from Cygnus X-1
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-sans">
            A high-octane 2D retro sci-fi arcade survival experience. Navigate dangerous orbital debris swarms and cosmic anomalies around an insatiable black hole accretion disk with responsive thruster controls.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 font-mono text-xs">
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-cosmos-800 bg-cosmos-950/80 p-4">
              <span class="font-bold text-brand-cyan block mb-1">Inertial Drifts</span>
              <span class="text-slate-400">Momentum-based propulsion mechanics built for precision maneuvers.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-cosmos-800 bg-cosmos-950/80 p-4">
              <span class="font-bold text-brand-amber block mb-1">Hazard Accretion</span>
              <span class="text-slate-400">Escalating orbital anomalies pulling you toward the event horizon.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-cosmos-800 bg-cosmos-950/80 p-4">
              <span class="font-bold text-brand-scarlet block mb-1">Arcade Purity</span>
              <span class="text-slate-400">Instant retries, high skill ceilings, and zero artificial grind.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Coming Soon Notice -->
          <div class="mt-10 rounded-xl border border-cosmos-800 bg-cosmos-950 p-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-brand-cyan animate-ping"></div>
              <div>
                <div class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Status</div>
                <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white font-sans">Targeting PC / Desktop & Web Release</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-cyan">
              Full reveal & gameplay trailers coming soon
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Studio Philosophy Note -->
      <div class="mt-12 text-center">
        <p class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">
          We build self-contained, complete games without microtransactions or manipulative retention traps.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
